WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:56.360
Wow, great! Your bed is softer than mine!

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:58.180
Really?

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:01.160
Lights out? <i> </i>

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:02.720
Lights out? Sure!

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.840
Good night. <i> </i>

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.310
Good night. Good night.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:06.920
Sorry I didn't call. <i> </i>

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.120
Sorry I didn't call. It's OK.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.860
Brother, dear Brother,

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:14.860
...it all began that night,

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:18.400
...when Mariko-san suddenly showed up at my house.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.080
Mariko-san?

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:34.950
Mariko-san!

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:36.910
Nanako-san!!

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:42.100
At that time, I hadn't the slightest idea,

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:46.360
...what sort of pain she was feeling, or why.

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:52.200
<b>27. An Incident of Bloodshed</b>

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:58.840
I'm sorry I came over so suddenly last night.

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:02.080
Your father and mother are SO nice!

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:06.710
Even after barging in like that, they said, "come and visit us again"...!

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:12.450
So, when can I visit again?

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:18.880
Say, Mariko-san...

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.280
What?

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:23.650
Oh, nothing...

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.130
Good morning!

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:26.330
Tomoko!

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.940
Good morning, Tomoko-san!

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:33.740
Mariko-san! Since when do you catch the train here?

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:37.890
Curious, aren't you? Well, I stayed at Nanako-san's last night!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.410
What?

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:43.480
I'm trying to take Nanako away from you!

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.050
Huh?

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:51.290
Mariko-san...

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:15.650
No time for any more practice now.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:16.720
OK.

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:20.850
I'm so sweaty! That's a drawback of morning practice.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:23.920
Yes, and there's never enough time for a shower.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.730
You're really improved a lot, Misaki-san!

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:28.600
Really? Thanks!

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:58.230
See you at lunch! <i> </i>

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.030
See you at lunch! OK!

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.700
Mariko-san, your slippers...?

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.170
I... I'll be right back.

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:28.860
Hello?

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:32.470
This is Mr. Ishikawa. I'm not in right now.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:36.800
Please leave your name and a message after the beep.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.870
I'll call you back...

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:57.220
Let me see your notes. I didn't understand that part.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:06:00.020
Sure, but I might not have it right, either...

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.310
Oh no! Homework! <i> </i>

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:02.220
Oh no! Homework! What?

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:04.160
1st period French...

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:07.760
Oh, wow, that's unusual.

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:13.700
I suppose even a Sorority member can forget her homework...

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:16.370
The Sorority represents the student body.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:18.710
So perhaps you two...

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:21.440
...should get your lives under better control.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:24.040
Don't listen to then, Misonoo-san.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.510
But even if you tried,

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:31.090
...some things in your life just can't be changed.

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:35.060
Isn't that so, Shinobu-san?

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:38.790
Listen, if you have something to say, say it!

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:41.660
What do you mean by that, I wonder?

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.670
Or is there really something?

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:51.340
There is! Your reaction tells me I'm right.

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:56.880
Shinobu-san, class is starting...

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.490
"A pornographer's legacy is pornography."

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:16.900
So what lies in store for the daughter of a pornographer?

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.780
Bitches like you never know when to quit!

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:34.520
That hurts! Let me go!

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.240
What are you doing!?

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.250
What on earth is going on??

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:40.780
Let me go, Kaoru-no-Kimi!

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:42.950
I hate her, I hate her!

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.930
It's OK. Calm down.

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:48.800
That really hurt. You're more vicious than my dog!

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:51.930
You're a low-down filthy bitch!

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:55.800
Bark as much as you want.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:08:00.400
You won't be at Seiran for that much longer...

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.210
What?

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.020
What does that mean?

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:08.150
Shinobu-san has to leave Seiran?

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.420
What did she mean?

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:20.910
You know, our generation prefers tight jeans over cotton pants.

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.710
This is only natural,

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.830
...since we have confidence in our figures.

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:27.500
Tomoko, you nut.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:43.120
Guess what. My parents are getting divorced!

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:44.050
What! <i> </i>

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:45.060
What! Di...

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.120
What! Di... ...vorced?

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:50.580
Don't look so serious!

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:50.590
It doesn't bother me one bit!
Don't look so serious!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:53.330
It doesn't bother me one bit!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.400
Mariko-san!

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.400
It happens al the time!

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:01.470
A man finds a lover, has an affair, then leaves his family.

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:05.610
It's so common these days that it doesn't even make good TV drama.

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:09.960
See! Didn't I always tell you,

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.240
...men just can't be trusted!

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:14.210
But it's such a nuisance!

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:17.360
My home is so dreary now.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:19.890
My Brother...

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:22.620
This is so exciting!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.960
I'm hoping for lots of alimony!

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:41.910
My dear Brother... Divorce!

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:45.580
Mariko-san's parents are going to divorce.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:50.650
Mariko-san spoke about it so lightly in front of us...

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:56.510
But this must've been the reason,

00:09:56.510 --> 00:10:01.930
...the reason that she cried so sadly at my house last night.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:07.670
Today, that same Mariko-an is cheerful,

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:09.600
...but her cheerfulness is forced.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:15.340
What should I do, my dear Brother?

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:19.410
What can I do for her, as her friend?

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.890
Wait... I'll just be a moment...

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.050
This is Mr. Ishikawa.

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:55.900
Hello!

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:57.990
Mariko?

00:10:58.110 --> 00:10:59.250
Yes.

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:00.570
How are you?

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:03.190
Fine. How about you?

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:05.590
I'm just fine.

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:07.660
Say, Papa... <i> </i>

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:08.530
Say, Papa... Yes?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:12.380
I'd like... to see you today.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:14.270
Would that be OK?

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.200
Today is sort of... you know...

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:18.470
I see.

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:20.410
I'm sorry, Mariko.

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:28.680
Um... is she done?

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:36.690
Sorry... thanks for waiting.

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:39.520
Hey, why don't you come along with me?

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:49.170
Wow, it's so soft! Puyo puyo!

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.970
See, Tomoko-san?

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:58.050
Huh? Oh, yes! You're right! See, Nanako! Feels good!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.510
Hmm!

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:01.850
It is!

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:26.410
It looks great on you, Miss!

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.410
Really?

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:29.940
Yes!

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:32.950
Isn't it a bit too subdued?

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:36.280
No, it's very chic.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.150
Really?

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:40.220
Beeeautiful!

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:43.760
OK. I've decided.

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:45.760
I'll take it, please.

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:46.560
OK!

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:51.500
Send the bill to the usual address.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.770
Certainly.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:56.300
Can you really spend that much without asking?

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:57.770
Sure, it's OK.

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:00.240
Now let's accessorize it...

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.380
What?

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:02.980
Come on, this way.

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:06.380
"Accessories, 4th floor please."

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.650
Pick anything you want.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:16.720
It's on me today.

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:19.130
Oh, I couldn't...!

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:22.000
It's my thanks for coming shopping with me.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:26.270
Then, chocolate cake and lemon tea!

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:27.740
Same for me.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:30.640
Is that all? Don't hold back...

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:32.340
This is fine.

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:34.340
I'm not that hungry, anyway.

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:40.280
Then, I'll have Key-lime pie, sorbet, crepes suzettes,

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:42.150
...and then lemon tea.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.220
Right away, Miss.

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.820
What's wrong?

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:51.200
Bang! You're too extravagant!

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:54.250
Hey, that's what you always say!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.960
You'll never change, I guess!

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.440
Just a minute. Excuse me.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:14.110
Papa!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:16.720
Papa?

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:19.650
Mariko?

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:22.320
Papa!

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:35.470
Mariko...

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:43.810
So... this is why... this is why you wouldn't see me today...!

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:45.920
Mariko...

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:52.620
Mariko-san!

00:14:58.490 --> 00:14:59.890
Mariko-san! Mariko-san!

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:26.650
Mariko? Is that you, Mariko?

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.660
Oh! Mariko.

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:30.390
I'm back.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:32.260
Welcome home.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:36.160
Aren't you angry? <i> </i>

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.060
Aren't you angry? What?

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:39.870
I didn't come home last night.

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:43.870
Misonoo-san's mother called me.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:49.080
But it was so lonely without you last night.

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:54.480
You must be hungry. Dinner will be ready soon.

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:57.620
I made your favorite, beef stew.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:00.290
I saw Papa today.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.820
That woman was with him!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.090
Oh? Really?

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:09.100
Is that all?

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:12.210
That's all you can say?

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:13.300
Mariko...

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:15.370
How can you pretend it's nothing all the time?

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:18.910
Why don't you say anything? Why don't you get angry?

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.930
You care about him don't you? You love him don't you?

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:27.720
You cry because he's gone don't you? Answer me!

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.650
Stop it, Mariko! Please!

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:32.650
...please...

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:36.260
You're...

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.400
Mama you're crying again!

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:57.680
Mama!

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:11.150
Hi! You forgot this. We brought it for you.

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:14.690
Thank you.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:32.770
I finally decided to just spend a lot of time with her.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:37.030
The pending divorce was a major problem,

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:40.180
...and I was powerless over something like that,

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.950
...but staying close to her might help.

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:47.050
I wouldn't be able to help Mariko-san directly,

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:51.790
...but I hoped to ease her pain at least a little.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:53.660
I figured that would be best.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:56.130
See you later!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:00.930
But, my Dear Brother, I was too optimistic.

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:07.070
That afternoon, my optimistic plans were destroyed.

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:23.490
Oh, Shinobu-san! I didn't think you'd show up today.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:26.560
What do you mean by that?

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:28.670
Don't you know?

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:32.430
You have such a famous father.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.370
Mr. Shinobu's divorce is official.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:41.110
Look, big headlines, and a picture!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:54.190
Your father's lover used to be an actress...

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.420
Isn't she beautiful?

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:59.530
You're met her, haven't you?

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:03.930
You want to know all about it don't you?

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:04.960
Misaki-san!

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:07.870
There's more... here.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:10.740
It says how much alimony your mother's getting...

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:11.620
Misaki-san!

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:13.740
What was that for?

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:16.210
Do you realize what you're doing?

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:17.950
No I don't.

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:19.640
How could I.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:24.150
I'm not one of the all-knowing members of the Sorority like you.

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:29.690
Here, you can take this... take a look at it later.

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:30.890
Misaki-san!

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:35.700
Anyway, it's the end for you.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:39.700
Your family gives a big endowment to Seiran.

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:42.840
Without it you may lose your membership in the Sorority,

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:46.440
...and your attendance at Seiran itself could be at risk.

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:53.310
But knowing you, you might still choose your father.

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:57.720
It's a difficult decision: take the money, or dump your mother...

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:15.940
Mariko-san!

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:31.820
Mu... Mu... Murderer!

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:34.760
Murderer!

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.290
Murderer!

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:49.970
What is it? What happened?

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:01.450
Mariko-san!

00:22:08.460 --> 00:22:10.320
What happened, Shinobu-san?

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:12.260
I'm sorry.

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:14.840
I'm sorry.

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:17.400
I'm sorry.

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:19.140
I'm sorry.

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:22.670
Mariko-san!

00:22:30.850 --> 00:22:33.200
I'm sorry, Nanako-san.

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:36.880
No!!!

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:42.550
My Brother...

00:23:42.550 --> 00:23:44.490
It wasn't Mariko-san's fault.

00:23:44.490 --> 00:23:47.820
I don't think it was really her fault.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:02.300 --> 00:25:04.880
PREVIEW.

00:25:04.880 --> 00:25:08.370
When she learns that the divorce caused this incident,

00:25:08.370 --> 00:25:11.040
Mariko's Mother is ridden with guilt.

00:25:11.200 --> 00:25:15.240
Mariko is also overcome with guilt feelings.

00:25:15.910 --> 00:25:20.580
Their family's love leads to their family's destruction.

00:25:20.780 --> 00:25:21.830
Next episode: <i> </i>

00:25:21.830 --> 00:25:23.980
Next episode: <b>The Christmas Candles</b>

00:25:24.490 --> 00:25:26.090
Brother, Dear Brother... <i> </i>

00:25:26.090 --> 00:25:28.720
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
